{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/200","id":4100985879,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQyCEds70cBQX","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/200","diff_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/200.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/200.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/issues/200","number":200,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix album visualization flicker and full-album joining","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization#199.\n\n- Pauses the live preview canvas loop while pipeline render/join tasks own the export canvas, including across page visibility changes.\n- Recognizes both inline and derived full-album tasks, so every track is visualized exactly once and completed track videos are reused in order.\n- Replaces raw `Blob` byte concatenation with a browser-native media-aware joiner that decodes the completed videos and records one valid output container, with MP4-to-WebM fallback.\n- Joins selected completed videos before direct full-album uploads and fixes numeric pipeline progress reporting.\n- Documents the root cause, history, alternatives, source data, logs, and browser evidence in the issue 199 case study.\n\n## Reproduction and verification\n\n- Before the fix, the minimal two-track Cypress regression called `convertWithFallback` three times and never called the album joiner.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand` — 10 suites, 354 tests passed.\n- `npm run typecheck` — passed.\n- `npm run lint` — passed.\n- `npm run build` — passed with the repository's existing Rollup warnings.\n- `npx cypress run --browser electron --spec cypress/e2e/pipeline-album-rendering.cy.js` — 2 passed, including two real browser-recorded WebM inputs and playback sampling of both joined segments.\n- `npx cypress run --browser electron --spec cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js` — 36 passed; the two unchanged stage-navigation/date assertions still fail at their pre-existing lines 271 and 438.\n- `npm run test:e2e` — 93 of 102 passed and all album tests passed. The nine unrelated failures were one intermittent pipeline reload assertion (which passed in the focused run), two unchanged navigator/date assertions, and six existing YouTube UI timing/sidebar-actionability failures; the complete log is preserved in the case study.\n- Playwright browser verification — 3 tasks completed, preview resumed, progress reached 100%, and three recordings were present.\n\n## Visual evidence\n\n### Before\n\n![Before: two tracks trigger three converter calls](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/blob/issue-199-616ebdabf596/docs/case-studies/issue-199/before-pipeline-album-rendering.png?raw=true)\n\n### After\n\n![After: two track recordings and one completed full-album recording](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/blob/issue-199-616ebdabf596/docs/case-studies/issue-199/after-pipeline-album-rendering.png?raw=true)\n\n## Case study\n\nSee [`docs/case-studies/issue-199/`](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/tree/issue-199-616ebdabf596/docs/case-studies/issue-199) for the reconstructed timeline, root-cause analysis, external references, alternatives, preserved reports, screenshots, and verification logs.\n","created_at":"2026-07-21T15:35:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T16:55:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"868d861b384987936a5afeea1b5903306c8c1e55","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/200/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/200/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/issues/200/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/statuses/66a526fc67bf103c24ca5a65e4eebead8705862f","head":{"label":"konard:issue-199-616ebdabf596","ref":"issue-199-616ebdabf596","sha":"66a526fc67bf103c24ca5a65e4eebead8705862f","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"htt